# REQUIRES: cargo
# The FRI prover, emitted: the value-faithful family's prover skeleton
# becomes a standalone crate whose seven holes are filled by kernels
# borrowed from the pinned upstream crates — commitment, fold,
# interpolation, and the reduced opening assembled from public
# primitives, with the stage-identical transcript peek grinding the
# nonce. The differential gate is byte equality against the replay
# runner, which drives the whole upstream pcs over the same fixture:
# the emitted crate must reproduce the runner's 132-byte wire and its
# challenge log exactly. That equality is exact rather than modulo the
# grind because both searches return the deterministic least witness —
# the emitted fill by the specification's canonical order, the upstream
# grind because nothing in either dependency graph enables
# p3-maybe-rayon's `parallel` feature, so its find-any is a serial
# ascending scan.

# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: zkc-family %S/../Oir/Inputs/plonky3-fri-vf.json --emit-vocabulary=%t/vocab.json --emit-spine=%t/spine.mlir
# RUN: zkc-opt '-pir-seal=protocol-vocabulary=%t/vocab.json construction-profile-registry=%zkc-registry-dir/construction-profiles.json' %t/spine.mlir -o %t/sealed.mlir
# RUN: zkc-opt '-pir-project=endpoint-kind=prover_skeleton protocol-vocabulary=%t/vocab.json construction-profile-registry=%zkc-registry-dir/construction-profiles.json' %t/sealed.mlir -o %t/prover.mlir
# RUN: zkc-translate --oir-canonical %t/prover.mlir -o %t/prover.json
# RUN: zkc-translate --oir-id %t/prover.mlir -o %t/prover.id

# The reference wire: the pinned upstream pipeline, end to end.
# RUN: cargo run --locked --quiet --manifest-path %zkc-replay-manifest --bin prove -- %t/prover.json > %t/runner.out
# RUN: %python %S/../Oir/Inputs/build-runner-vectors.py %t/runner.out %t/prover.id %t/prover-vectors.json prover

# The emitted crate replays the corpus: the producing control must
# match the runner byte for byte, and the short-payload refusal names
# the opening fill's own convention.
# RUN: cargo run --locked --quiet --manifest-path %zkc-emit-manifest -p zkc-emit -- --doc %t/prover.json --binding %zkc-emit-bindings/plonky3-zero-iv.json --rt-path %zkc-rt-dir --vectors %t/prover-vectors.json --out %t/prover-crate --crate-name zkc-prover-fri
# RUN: cargo test --quiet --manifest-path %t/prover-crate/Cargo.toml
